<title>SINGAPORE: Forte Hotels' Le Meridien to open Bali resort.</title>
<headline>Forte Hotels' Le Meridien to open Bali resort.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Le Meridien Hotels and Resorts, part of the Forte Hotels group, said on Monday it is planning to open a golf and spa resort in Bali on June 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the resort, on a 108-hectare parcel of land on the Indonesian island's south-west coast, would include a Greg Norman-inspired championship golf course, conference facilities and a marine spa.</p>
<p>Forte Plc, the family-run hotel and catering empire, was acquired by British media and leisure company Granada Group earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
